name tatoeba
# sentences_in_lists.csv names lists only by id, and tags_detailed.csv and tag_metadata.csv have no documented
# fields: nothing in them is content, and they are not read.
# Tatoeba's weekly exports: tables of tab-separated fields, without a header row. Tatoeba's page "Download sentences"
# names every file's fields ("Fields and structure"); it is kept beside the files, in "documentation".
# What Tatoeba says is of whole sentences: a sentence, its language, who wrote it, which sentences translate it, its
# tags, lists, audio and reviews. It says nothing of a sentence's words one by one.
witness Tatoeba
class UserCuratedResource
root $LAPLACE_DATA/.refresh-*/Tatoeba
# Measured, not loaded: 294,452,005 compositions from 3,191 MB, at 750 bytes each with their indexes and standings.
room 69
after iso-639 wiktionary conceptnet
